## Governance Root and Authority

The Human/Organization remains the GovernanceRoot. Agent autonomy is bounded by the Human/Organizational GovernanceEnvelope.

- Declared Authority holder: **{{.Project.AuthorityHolder}}**
- Human approval declared: **{{.Project.HumanApproval}}**
- Policy enforcement mechanism: **{{.Project.PolicyMechanism}}**

`Capability != Authority` and `Approval != AuthorityGrant` remain mandatory semantic boundaries.

